        {
          "type": "pieges",
          "items": [
            "<i>I enjoy to read</i> → <i>I enjoy **reading**.</i>",
            "<i>She decided leaving</i> → <i>She decided **to leave**.</i>",
            "<i>look forward to see</i> → <i>look forward to **seeing**.</i>",
            "<i>before to leave</i> → <i>before **leaving**.</i>",
            "<i>I stopped to smoke</i> ≠ <i>I stopped smoking</i> : le contraire."
